From 14f79ab47ec3d2ca2b90139c8cb49492e216cab9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:28:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 44/56] Guide: Active Downloads; Notifications and presence as
 xam keeps them

Personal Settings > Active Downloads: XamShowMarketplaceUI(user, 0xA) (xam 818EE4D8, message 0x2100A) opens marketplace.xex's ActiveDownloads.xur without Xbox Live checks for this type (90107F34). With no background downloads (901133A0) its list hides, txtNoDownloads shows and LegendA is cleared; B returns to Options on Active Downloads.

Notifications: XNotifyUISetOptions (818DA938) keeps show / sound in XCONFIG_USER_RETAIL_FLAGS bits 0x10 / 0x20 (set = off), read at start-up (818DACE8); the Guide now uses retail_flags instead of its own cvars. Online Status: the preset presence state is per sign-in slot (xam user table +0x198, 818E8EA0), 0 until set, which hud shows as no radio selected.

dump_patched_system_modules also writes marketplace.xex.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D8Y8uNNBmKZ7J6MZXNhzHq
